  "title": "COVID-19, Influenza, and RSV Wastewater Monitoring in the U.S. | Week of May 16, 2026",
  "summary": "Summary: Week of 5/16/26 Biobot’s nationwide network shows a quieter respiratory virus picture across the U.S. Overall, COVID-19 and influenza A are holding steady at very low levels nationally, while influenza B, RSV, and HMPV are decreasing. Regionally, the pattern is reassuring too: all viruses are either decreasing or staying very low across the […]",
